(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze the career avenues for electrical engineers in Public Sector Undertakings \(PSUs\) like NTPC, PGCIL, and BHEL via the GATE examination.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Career Pathways in Indian Public Sector Undertakings \(PSUs\):) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Recruitment Gateway - GATE \(Graduate Aptitude Test in Engineering\):) Tj
T*
(   Premier central Public Sector Undertakings \(Maharatna and Navratna enterprises\) recruit) Tj
T*
(   Graduate Engineer Trainees \(Executive Trainees\) strictly based on GATE percentile rankings) Tj
T*
(   followed by behavioral interviews and group discussions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Specialized PSU Roles:) Tj
T*
(   - NTPC Limited \(Power Generation\): Electrical engineers manage 660/800 MW supercritical) Tj
T*
(   boiler-turbine-generator units, excitation systems, distributed control systems \(DCS\), static) Tj
T*
(   switchgear, gas insulated switchyards \(GIS\), and large utility solar/green hydrogen pilot) Tj
T*
(   plants.) Tj
T*
(   - PGCIL \(Power Grid Corporation of India Limited\): Engineers oversee inter-state bulk) Tj
T*
(   transmission systems spanning 400 kV/765 kV EHV-AC lines, $\\pm 800$ kV HVDC bipoles, Substation) Tj
T*
(   Automation Systems \(SAS, IEC 61850\), and Wide Area Monitoring Systems \(WAMS\).) Tj
T*
(   - BHEL \(Heavy Manufacturing\): Focuses on research, design, and manufacturing of heavy) Tj
T*
(   electrical machinery: turbo-generators, traction motors for Indian Railways \(Vande Bharat) Tj
T*
(   trains\), HVDC converter transformers, and high-voltage $SF_6$ switchgear.) Tj
T*
(   - POSOCO / Grid Controller of India: Manages National and Regional Load Dispatch Centers) Tj
T*
(   \(NLDC/RLDC\), performing real-time generation-load dispatch, economic scheduling, grid frequency) Tj
T*
(   regulation, and congestion management.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
