(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the role of Electrical Engineers in Semiconductor, VLSI, and Embedded Systems design companies.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Electrical Engineers in Semiconductors & Embedded Systems:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Semiconductor Hardware Companies \(Texas Instruments, Qualcomm, Intel, Infineon,) Tj
T*
(   STMicroelectronics\):) Tj
T*
(   - Power Management IC \(PMIC\) Design: Sizing buck, boost, and LDO converters for) Tj
T*
(   microprocessors, requiring deep mastery of analog circuit design, parasitic inductance, and) Tj
T*
(   thermal dissipation.) Tj
T*
(   - Analog & Mixed-Signal Verification: Designing high-speed ADCs/DACs, phase-locked loops) Tj
T*
(   \(PLLs\), operational amplifiers, and RF transceivers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Embedded Firmware Engineering:) Tj
T*
(   - Low-level bare-metal and RTOS firmware programming in C/C++ on ARM Cortex-M microcontrollers.) Tj
T*
(   - Developing device drivers for industrial communication buses: SPI, I2C, UART, CANbus, and) Tj
T*
(   Modbus.) Tj
T*
(   - Real-time motor control firmware implementation: SVPWM generation, ADC sampling) Tj
T*
(   synchronization, and fault trip interrupts within sub-microsecond deadlines.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
