(   [Problem Statement]: Explain Variable Frequency Drives \(VFDs\): Topologies, rectifiers, DC bus filtering, inverters, and scalar V/f vs. vector control.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Variable Frequency Drive \(VFD\) Systems:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Hardware Power Stage:) Tj
T*
(   - AC-to-DC Converter: 3-phase diode bridge or active IGBT rectifier converting 50 Hz AC utility) Tj
T*
(   power to unregulated DC.) Tj
T*
(   - DC Intermediate Bus: Large electrolytic capacitor banks and inductors filtering voltage) Tj
T*
(   ripple and absorbing regenerative braking energy.) Tj
T*
(   - DC-to-AC Inverter: Six insulated-gate bipolar transistors \(IGBTs\) with anti-parallel) Tj
T*
(   freewheeling diodes controlled via PWM to synthesize variable-frequency, variable-voltage AC.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Control Strategies:) Tj
T*
(   - Scalar V/f Control: Maintains a constant ratio of stator voltage to frequency \($V/f =) Tj
T*
(   \\text{const}$\) to preserve constant magnetic flux. Simple and robust for pumps and fans, but) Tj
T*
(   exhibits poor dynamic torque response at low speeds.) Tj
T*
(   - Vector / Field-Oriented Control \(FOC\): Decomposes stator current into orthogonal) Tj
T*
(   flux-producing \($i_d$\) and torque-producing \($i_q$\) components using coordinate) Tj
T*
(   transformations, delivering instantaneous torque control from zero speed to full load.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 10:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Discuss the career pathway, skills, and industry certifications for Energy Auditors and Energy Managers under the Bureau of Energy Efficiency \(BEE\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Energy Management & BEE Certification Career Pathways:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Regulatory Framework:) Tj
T*
(   Under India's Energy Conservation Act \(2001\), designated commercial and industrial energy) Tj
T*
(   consumers \(cement, thermal plants, steel, railways\) are legally mandated to appoint certified) Tj
T*
(   Energy Managers and undergo mandatory periodic Energy Audits.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. BEE Certification Exam:) Tj
T*
(   Conducted annually by the National Productivity Council \(NPC\) on behalf of the Bureau of Energy) Tj
T*
(   Efficiency \(BEE\). Requires passing four rigorous papers:) Tj
T*
