T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   EV DC Fast Charging Station Architecture:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Grid AC Front-End: 3-phase 415V/11kV grid connection, isolation transformer, and active) Tj
T*
(   bidirectional PFC rectifier stage synthesizing a 700V-1000V DC bus with unity power factor.) Tj
T*
(   2. Isolated DC-DC Stage: Multiple parallel LLC resonant or Dual Active Bridge \(DAB\) converter) Tj
T*
(   modules providing galvanic isolation and regulating charge current.) Tj
T*
(   3. Charging Gun & Interface: Liquid-cooled CCS-2 or CHAdeMO connectors delivering up to 350-500) Tj
T*
(   A continuous current.) Tj
T*
(   4. Communication Protocol: High-level digital communications over Control Pilot \(CP\) line using) Tj
T*
(   Power Line Communication \(PLC\) following ISO 15118 standard \(Plug & Charge\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
