(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Offshore Wind Energy Transmission:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. High-Power Array Cables: Medium-voltage \(33 kV or 66 kV\) 3-core XLPE submarine cables) Tj
T*
(   collect power from individual offshore wind turbine towers to an offshore substation.) Tj
T*
(   2. Long-Distance Bulk Transmission: For distances $< 80\\text{ km}$, 220 kV HVAC 3-core) Tj
T*
(   submarine cables are used, requiring heavy onshore and offshore reactive power compensation.) Tj
T*
(   For distances $> 80\\text{ km}$, HVDC transmission using offshore Voltage Source Converter) Tj
T*
(   platforms is mandatory to eliminate reactive charging losses.) Tj
T*
() Tj
